      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "WIN'S FOR FUN (1) hit the ground running and set it up early clocking 17.29 with a 1.5 lengths win at this track over 300m. Can continue the winning form. ORANA JET (2) finished in the placings last time but could not have been more impressive before that in his sharp 17.18 win at this track over 300m. Top win two back and rates a key player again. ZATARA MAC (3) is a talented type and proved too strong last time to win by half a length at this track in a handy 17.28 beating Junk Yard Jeff. Has definite claims. BOILER MAKER (5) has ability and can feature with the right run after missing a cheque here most recently.",
